    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">Each restricted stock unit (&quot;RSU&quot;) represents a contingent right to receive one share of the common stock of Byrna Technologies Inc. (the &quot;Issuer&quot;)</footnote>
        <footnote id="F2">The 561 RSUs were granted in connection with the Reporting Person's appointment as an independent director on the Issuer's board of directors and reflect a pro rata share of the equity portion of the base salary of all directors for the Issuer's 2025-26 Annual Meeting Cycle. Pursuant to the terms of the grant, the RSUs vested on September 25, 2026, were required to be settled by March 15, 2027, and were settled on November 6, 2026.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F3">The 25,848 RSUs were granted as part of the director's base compensation for the 2026-2027 Annual Meeting cycle. They vest on the earlier of one year from the grant date or the 2027 Annual Meeting of Shareholders provided that is at least 50 weeks after the 2026 Annual Meeting and contingent on service on the vesting date, and must be settled by March 15 of the year following vesting.</footnote>
